      "label": "Misogynous Stereotype: Woman's Gaze as Sexualized or Manipulative",
      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that a woman's gaze, especially when coy or seductive, is inherently suggestive or manipulative, reducing her to an object of desire or control. This trope is rooted in misogynous cultural narratives that objectify women by focusing on their appearance and perceived sexual availability.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
